description: >-
  The vision, mission, and pillars of the Human Building Synergy Laboratory
  (HUBS) at the University of Arizona.
---
{% from "icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="pageHero wrap">
  <p class="label">About the lab</p>
  <h1>
    <span class="c-hu">HU</span>man <span class="c-bl">B</span>uilding
    <span class="c-ai">S</span>ynergy Laboratory
  </h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Founded in 2022, the lab is where researchers try to build the synergy
    between humans, AI, and buildings.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="band band--tight wrap">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="label">Vision</p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:.5rem">Synergy is not a compromise.</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--ink-2)">
      Every building today asks somebody to give something up — comfort for
      energy, energy for cost, one occupant's afternoon for another's. HUBS is
      built on the conviction that this is an engineering failure, not a law of
      physics. Fiction already shows what the alternative looks like: an
      intelligence that knows what you need, acts before you ask, explains itself
      when questioned, and never takes the last word. We are building it for the
      room you are actually standing in.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="band__head measure">
    <p class="label">Mission</p>
    <h2>The questions we keep asking.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      One question per corner of the triangle, and one that belongs to all three.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid--2">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head c-hu">Of the human</p>
      <ul>
        <li>How do people express their needs?</li>
        <li>How do they differ from each other?</li>
        <li>What makes individuals effective collaborators with buildings?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head c-ai">Of the AI</p>
      <ul>
        <li>How should an AI agent act effectively with humans and buildings?</li>
        <li>What capabilities should AI possess?</li>
        <li>How far can AI go?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head c-bl">Of the building</p>
      <ul>
        <li>What do buildings need?</li>
        <li>How can buildings be seamlessly integrated with AI?</li>
        <li>How can building systems better support and integrate with humans?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head">Of all three</p>
      <ul>
        <li>How can they be in the positive loop consistently?</li>
        <li>What creates synergies between them?</li>
        <li>Can they be in harmony?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="band__head measure">
    <p class="label">Pillars</p>
    <h2>What holds the work up.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid--2">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head c-hu">Human agency</p>
      <p class="muted">
        The occupant keeps authority. An override is the most valuable signal the
        system receives, not a failure of it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head c-ai">Machine reasoning</p>
      <p class="muted">
        Agents that plan under real constraints — grid, cost, physics, other
        people — and can say what they did and why.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head c-bl">Physical embodiment</p>
      <p class="muted">
        Sensing and actuation that reach the scale of a single person, and report
        back what actually happened.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="card__head">Synergy</p>
      <p class="muted">
        Comfort and energy treated as a win-win to be engineered, not a trade-off
        to be split.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--rule band--tight wrap">
  <div class="cta">
    <p class="label">Next</p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:.8rem">See what the questions have produced.</h2>
    <div class="btnRow">
      <a class="btn" href="/research/">Research {{ icon("arrow-right") }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/facility/">The facility</a>
      <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/join-us/">Join us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

